    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office opened in Seelyville in 1878, marking the town's early establishment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seelyville%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Seelyville lies east of Terre Haute along U.S. Route 40 and is part of the Terre Haute Metropolitan Statistical Area.",
